rooms_desc ({"You take a look around and notice happily, that you've arrived in awarm, friendly place, nice spices around in the air. You feel safe here,you are likely to take a little nap on the sofa in front of you. Yousee a huge, strong table, a woodden chair, and you notice the soft andnice carpet under your feet. Allsiante is standing in front of yousmiling and inviting you to take a seat near him. He may have got aspare bottle of beer for you :)","You hardly can see anything inside the bathroom... The room is filledwith hot steam. There's a large bath tube to your right side and a showerto the left. There's a toilet to the right of the shower cabin and yousee a big blue towel hanging on the wall near the cabin. A small windowopens on the wall in front of you.If Allsiante's in the tube, you'd better leave quickly :) Unless youwanna join him... (very few _women_ could up to now :)) Don't forgetto close the door behind you - after you leave, of course :)","You arrived in the hall of Allsiante's home. There's nothing in hereexcept the coathanger with Allsiante's robes. You can leave yourstuffs here, they'll be safe, while having fun with Allsiante.To the west there is Allsiante's living-resting-time spending room.Go ahead, meet him !",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Allsiante's home...","Allsiante's bathroom.","Allsiante's home's hall.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
furnishings ({0,"","",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
items ({({"sofa","A long, soft, brown coloured sofa.","table","A strong, high, woodden table.","chair","A strong, woodden chair.","carpet","A wonderfully coloured and very soft, large carpet covering the floor.","standing-lamp","The only source of dim light in the room. Pleasant though,",}),({"bath tube","It's a large bath-tube designed for two persons - hot steaming water in it.","water","Bright blue-coloured hot water, smelly spices added :)","towel","A large blue towel, soft and puffy - maybe you should use it :))","toilet","Hey, it's just a toilet ! :)","shower","It's a shower-cabin, also spacey enough for two people ....","window","A little window, don't worry nobody's out there to peep :)",}),({"Allsiante's home's hall.","coathanger","It's a large coathanger for Allsiante's robe and coats.","**",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
